# Local agent/tooling scratch. None of it is an input to the app, the gates or
# CI, and all of it regenerates on demand — but while untracked-and-unignored it
# buries the genuinely load-bearing untracked files in `git status`, which is how
# scripts/_verdict.mjs (imported by scripts/verify-all.mjs) sat uncommitted long
# enough for a `git commit -a` to have shipped a gate that cannot start.
/.antigravity/
/gemini-out/
/graphify-out/
/verif-logs/
